  "scope": "Actual original endpoint-list component discovery. Constructs zero-weight records and the graph matrix internally, generates every vertex index, executes the existing zero-weight shortest-path machine separately for each vertex and returns the distinct component vertices in increasing order. The same actual trace has an input-only rational-atom transition bound. Original edge list is input; no matrix, component list, reachability bit or path is supplied. Whole canonical component enumeration, forest/seed construction, random generation, fuel-expression evaluation and bit complexity remain separate.",
